 "titulo": "Room 12 called the front desk. We have 11 rooms 📞 Part 1 #horror #shorts",
 "capa": "THERE IS NO ROOM 12",
 "descripcion": "Jonah works the night desk at an 11-room motel. At 3:14 AM, the phone line for room 12 lit up.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWould you answer?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "The Pine Rest Motel has eleven rooms. The phone at the desk has twelve lines.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I'm Jonah. I work the night desk, eleven to seven, alone.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "On my first night, the owner taped three rules under the counter.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "There is no room twelve.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "If line twelve rings, answer it, and say we're full.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "And never hand out the key with the red tag.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The red tag key hangs on the board, at the end. Number twelve.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "For two nights, nothing happened. Truckers, a couple, a guy with a dog.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "On night three, at 3:14 AM, line twelve lit up.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "I let it ring four times. Then I picked up.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "A woman's voice. Very calm. My husband went out for ice an hour ago.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He never came back. Can you check the machine?",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I said what the rule said. I'm sorry, ma'am. We're full.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "She laughed, very softly. I'm not asking for a room.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I'm standing at your window.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "I looked up. A woman stood outside the glass, in the rain.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "She was holding the key with the red tag.",
   "pausa": 0.9
  },
  {
   "texto": "Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
